 "krystiliaNote": "Krystilia's tasks only count in the Wilderness. tasks maps the monster links of the Tasks table on her wiki page to task ids, monsters adds spawn pages for her own tasks, and aliases maps a place name on her page to a location key. wholePlaces names places whose wiki page says all of the place lies in the Wilderness, for tiles outside RuneLite's Wilderness areas.",
 "dossierPlacesNote": "Task name to location key, for dossier best locations that name a place in words the automatic match cannot see. Gryphons: the dossier names the task-only eastern cave, which the gryphon guide calls the Eastern gryphon dungeon.",
 "dossierPrefixesNote": "Mirror of TaskDestination.forTask in the plugin. SlayerLocationsTest fails when the two disagree.",
 "aliasesNote": "Keys are wiki link targets or the cleaned location text of a table row or LocLine. Text matches win over link matches."
}
